  - button: {fileID: 1254321241}
    title: NaCl
    description: "Info: Amber solution. Flushes bile and restores the liver\u2019s
      natural color. Recommended for jaundice and weak immunity.\nHow to use: Pour
      over the organ after cleaning. Wait until the yellow tint fades."
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46ead4f843fcd494c8b32230f57dd0e3, type: 3}
  - button: {fileID: 763189170}
    title: ANTI-VIR
    description: 'Info: Saline solution. Rinses blood and debris. Harmless, but treats
      nothing.

      How to use: Pour over the organ during cleaning. Safe for any
      organ.

      How to use: Pour over the organ after cleaning. Wait until the
      yellow tint fades.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f099635bd46d3f04bb5d80219a7fe6b9, type: 3}
  - button: {fileID: 1364277220}
    title: REGEN-MED
    description: 'Info: Regenerating ointment. Dissolves scar tissue and softens
      stiff lung tissue. For fibrosis and shortness of breath.

      How to use:
      Spread a thin, even layer. Too much makes the organ soft and weak.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 117219a9a52d2d145ad9e701b20aaa5c, type: 3}
  - button: {fileID: 226496953}
    title: CRYO-GEL
    description: 'Info: Cooling gel. Slows decay and keeps the organ fresh. Does
      not treat disease.

      How to use: Apply before packing. Helps only with
      freshness.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 544ef7d3d754e1f42b197908383ad1a0, type: 3}
  - button: {fileID: 883140144}
    title: NEUTRALIZER
    description: 'Info: Chemical neutralizer. Removes toxins and acid residue. Too
      harsh for living tissue.

      How to use: Use only on stains and grime. Never
      apply to the organ itself.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f2ab953a01ba1048aa65a658b2185cf, type: 3}
  - button: {fileID: 883140144}
    title: RT:BLACK
    description: 'nfo: Rhythm stabilizer paste. Steadies an irregular heartbeat and
      strengthens a weak pulse. For cardiomyopathy. How to use: Press into the base
      of the organ. Wait for the rhythm to even out before packing.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e37765dd2708d94dbb8456e43f601a2, type: 3}
